# Data & security

- RLS on every new `public` table in the same migration.
- Use `@campuz360/auth` helpers; verify with `getUser()` on the server.
- Never authorize from `user_metadata`. Use roles/permissions + `has_permission` / `get_user_permissions`.
- Never expose `service_role` via `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` or client components.
- Audit Nexus role grants/suspensions in `audit_events`.
- Create migrations with `supabase migration new` — do not invent filenames casually.
